    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors and intended refusals",
      "description": "429 is plotted SEPARATELY from 4xx and never with 5xx: capacity-plan §7 item 4 makes an intended refusal a success of the limiter, and folding it into the error rate would make a working rate limiter look like an outage. The k6 harness grades it the same way (deploy/load/lib/metrics.js).",
